ata-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RightContinuous}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{RightContinuous}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (right-continuity predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}right\\text{-}continuous}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RightContinuous}_S(f,t,X,d)\n\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,[0,\\infty),X)\\land\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land t\\in[0,\\infty)\n\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall s\\in[0,\\infty)\\;\n\\bigl(t\\leq s&lt;t+\\delta\\to d(f(s),f(t))&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}right\\text{-}continuous}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RightContinuous}_S(f,t,X,d)\n\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,[0,\\infty),X)\\land\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land t\\in[0,\\infty)\n\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall s\\in[0,\\infty)\\;\n\\bigl(t\\leq s&lt;t+\\delta\\to d(f(s),f(t))&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Right continuity is used in cadlag processes and filtrations.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97"